WEBVTT

00:21:01.142 --> 00:21:08.142
(Music)

00:21:11.649 --> 00:21:12.943
(Music continues)

00:21:12.967 --> 00:21:15.336
Burnout isn't an individual problem.

00:21:15.360 --> 00:21:17.555
It's an organizational problem,

00:21:17.579 --> 00:21:19.364
and it's contagious.

00:21:19.388 --> 00:21:20.871
Studies of nurses and doctors

00:21:20.895 --> 00:21:23.916
show that when one person
becomes emotionally exhausted,

00:21:23.940 --> 00:21:26.846
their coworkers
are more likely to catch it.

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:29.706
And it affects the people
you serve as well.

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:31.111
When teachers are burned out,